@startuml Linkwise_Modem_Keying
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
hide footbox
participant "Session owner" as Session
participant "DSP / playback" as DSP
participant "PTT arbiter" as PTT
participant "Watchdog" as WD
participant "Device driver" as HW
Session -> DSP: encode burst
DSP --> Session: samples / route / duration
Session -> PTT: key-up(session, lease, config, budget)
PTT -> PTT: validate policy and interlocks
PTT -> WD: arm expiry and airtime limit
PTT -> HW: qualified assertion / observation
PTT --> Session: permitted route / denial
Session -> DSP: play owned sample buffer
DSP -> HW: scheduled audio
HW --> DSP: presentation complete / error
DSP --> Session: actual completion
Session -> PTT: release
PTT -> HW: release and readback
PTT --> Session: observed release / unknown
Session -> Session: advance TX token; arm RX deadline
note over Session,HW
 Proposed integration: denial or playback failure aborts the normal path.
 The watchdog releases independently on controller loss or expiry.
 No model response or MCP call times this sequence.
end note
@enduml
